sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / KServe ingress
    participant API as vLLM API server<br/>odh-vllm-gaudi-rhel9<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Engine as vLLM engine
    participant HPU as HpuPlatform / Gaudi HPU<br/>(Habana PyTorch, in-process)
    participant Storage as Model storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Decode as Decode instance<br/>(NIXL peer, optional)

    Note over API,Storage: Startup: model weights downloaded (upstream vLLM / KServe storage initializer)
    Engine->>Storage: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS, deployment-supplied creds
    Storage-->>Engine: Model artifacts

    Note over Client,HPU: Flow 1: Inference request
    Client->>API: POST /v1/chat/completions, /v1/completions, /v1/embeddings<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP, no TLS by default<br/>Auth: delegated to platform / optional --api-key
    API->>Engine: Schedule request
    Engine->>HPU: Execute model (in-process / device)
    HPU-->>Engine: Tokens / logits
    Engine-->>API: Generated output
    API-->>Client: JSON / SSE response

    Note over Client,API: Health and metrics
    Client->>API: GET /health, /metrics<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP, no auth
    API-->>Client: 200 / Prometheus metrics

    Note over HPU,Decode: Flow 2: Disaggregated prefill/decode (optional)
    HPU->>Decode: KV-cache transfer via HPU NIXL connector<br/>port deployment-defined, NIXL/UCX<br/>encryption not specified, no auth in plugin
